WEBVTT

00:07:58.976 --> 00:08:00.746
I obožava skakati.

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:02.150
(Lavež psa)

00:08:02.174 --> 00:08:04.637
(Lavež psa i zvuk opruge)

00:08:08.636 --> 00:08:10.506
Ovo je nova vrsta zootropa

00:08:11.196 --> 00:08:13.661
koju sam razvio u
Institutu za istraživanje slike

00:08:13.661 --> 00:08:16.168
Sveučilišta Maryland u Baltimoreu.

00:08:17.105 --> 00:08:19.328
Nazvao sam ga "zootrop
u stvarnom vremenu".

00:08:19.352 --> 00:08:21.935
(Lavež psa)

00:08:21.959 --> 00:08:24.325
(Lavež psa i zvuk opruge)

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:26.631
Hvala vam.

00:08:26.905 --> 00:08:28.288
(Pljesak)